  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - You did it!
  - You have successfully made the new TRANSFORMER production line for the Neural
    Factory! With this final output, we can look at the number in the row with the
    highest probability and pick that product, or output token, as the result of
    a given order of resources, or input token sequence. Given enough training data,
    this TRANSFORMER can guess output tokens with accuracies up to 99,6%!
  - Before you leave, let's quickly look back to how far you have come...
